----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Custom Scan (LionCount)
   Partitions: spq_1, spq_2a, spq_empty, spq_4
   Lion Indexes: (v >= '-20000'::integer AND v <= 30000), (g = 3)
   Range From Slices: v >= '-20000'::integer AND v <= 30000 (32 slices)
   Aggregates From Slices: (w: every bit counted), (ts: existence counted, max descent)
(5 rows)

